  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Live and invest in blue chip location.\r\n\r\n43A Eastcliffe Road, CASTOR BAY -  Freehold  land 722m2 - Price - $2,495,000\r\n\r\nThey say real estate is simple: buy the best location you can afford.\r\n\r\nThis is your opportunity to secure a substantial block and cedar home in one of the North Shore's most sought-after coastal neighbourhoods.\r\nVacant, generously proportioned  home awaits a new family,  you can move right in ready for Christmas.  Recently re-painted with new carpet installed and renovated family bathroom this home is ready to occupy.  The added benefit here is you can also add value by dropping in a new kitchen when ready.  The layout offers flexibility with 2 bedrooms upstairs and 2 downstairs, 2 living rooms and 3 full bathrooms.  The lower lounge has access to a private terrace and could be used as an office, flexi space or bedroom as this offers external access without the need to traverse the home. \r\n\r\nPositioned to capture the northern sun and beautiful Rangitoto views, this elevated home enjoys excellent natural light from morning through to evening. With double internal garage and abundant off street parking with additional carport  for boat or RV, this is truly a home to embrace for all the family.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to move in immediately, rent out, accommodate extended family, or relax this property has it all.  The combination of land size, northern orientation, privacy, water views and a premium coastal location make this an opportunity that stands apart.\r\n\r\nCastor Bay is prized for its lifestyle, school zones and proximity to the coast. Both properties are within the highly sought-after Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High School zones, with Campbells Bay Primary School and Wairau Intermediate also within easy reach.\r\nCastor Bay Beach, Milford Beach and Castor Bay Tennis Club are all close by, putting the best of the North Shore coastal lifestyle right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nOpportunity knocks - this time, it comes with a Rangitoto view.  \r\n\r\nFor property files, please copy and paste this link: https://vltre.co/OX243D",
